window.products.push({"id":264055,"name":"Hand Mixer Electric, Updated 7-Speed Lightweight Handheld Whisk, Multi-purpose Hand-Held Electric Mixer Stainless Steel Egg Whisk with 2 Beaters Stick","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61REsv-XsnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"📣📣 Wanna make a delicious meal for your family? 🎂🎂 Hand mixer is exactly what you need. The hand mixer features Seven-speed settings and high-quality stainless steel attachments, which could helps you effortlessly whisk, mix and knead for baking and cooking. SPECIFICATION - Material: Stainless Steel, PVC - Rated voltage: 110V - Frequency: 60HZ - Work stalls: 1-7 File/ Variable Speeds FEATURES 🍕7 grades of speed, stable stirring without staining the countertop. 🍕Twin beater blades with stainless steel material, heavy-duty and rust-resistant, cut through and blend thick dry and wet ingredients. 🍕One-Click Eject, free up troublesome disassembly and assembly problems. SEVEN SPEED GRADE Brings the beaters up to the selected slow \"1\" speed, gradually adjust up speed to prevent ingredients from splashing. Obvious speed difference between 1-7 speed level. ☻1-2 Grade: Mixing original speed - used for dry mixed items such as flour, butter, potatoes. ☻3 Grade: Mixing original speed - in with liquid 's material, such as salad dressing etc. ☻4-5 Grade: Used mixing cake, cookies, simple bread dough material. ☻6 Grade: In cream, butter, sugar spend, free baked such as the candy, desserts snacks. ☻7 Grade: Used eggs sent, frosting , mashed potatoes, (milk fatty) gas-foaming with milk etc. HOW TO USE? 1.Push the beaters into slots,slightly turning until locking into proper position. 2.Immerse the beaters into products mixture. 3.Plug the mixer into the wall socket. 4.When the desired consistency is reached, slide the speed control switch “0” position. Wait until the beaters stops and unplug mixer. 5.Press beaters release button and remove the beaters. PACKAGE CONTENT 🍣1 x Electric Egg Beater 🍣2 x Egg Sticks 🍣2 x Dough Sticks 🍣1 x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61REsv-XsnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOFOIT","source_asin":"B08K7JVLTN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-264055","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K7JVLTN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K7JVLTN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
