window.products.push({"id":264103,"name":"Biziein Carbon Steel Wok 13\", 9 Pcs Wok Pans Wooden Handle with Lid and Wok Ring- Includes 6 Wok Utensils, Chinese Stir Fry Wok Flat Bottom for Electr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OL6otg81L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【9PCS Stir Fry Wok & Utensils Set】Except 12.6'' carbon steel wok and wooden lid, you can also get wok brush, wok ring and 6pcs stainless steel wok utensils with wooden handle, including: 1x rice spoon, 1x wok spatula, 1x slotted spatula, 1x slotted spoon, 1x spaghetti spoon. Owning this all-in-one Asian wok set makes cooking easier, faster and more efficient. 【Ergonomic Design】The step design made the wooden lid match the pan very well; The V-shape soup mouth is easy for pouring soup; The detachable handle is made of solid wooden, can resist high temperature cooking; The hanging ring is designed for hanging storage and saving kitchen space. It's a perfect gift for your family, friends or colleagues. 【Multifunctional Wok Pan】Biziein stir frying wok pan can serve 3-5 people of food at least, it's an ideal for family use or small gathering. The wok pan can be used in various cooking methods of Asian food like pan-frying, braising, boiling, steaming, deep-frying and etc. Besides, the flat bottom wok heats up evenly and quickly on all types of stoves: gas, electric, halogen stove & induction. 【Health & Durable】Combination of carbon steel and balanced design make the wok easily flip and stir-fry; No chemical coatings—PFOA-free; The surface has a honeycomb design which means it doe not only has hardness surface, but can reduce scratches and maintain its beauty. Adopted nitriding craftsmanship to avoid rusting, so it's more durable and healthier than the coated non-stick pan. 【Life Time Guarantee & Tips】If your using experience with this wok set is not absolutely exceptional, simply contact us for full refund, we will spare no effort to help you solve problem! Please season the wok before use! A well-seasoned carbon steel wok provides a safe, healthy and non-stick cooking surface for your family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OL6otg81L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Biziein","source_asin":"B09CL458X3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-264103","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CL458X3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CL458X3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
