window.products.push({"id":264237,"name":"AicLuze Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set of 2 -𝐔𝐩𝐠𝐫𝐚𝐝𝐞𝐝 USB Rechargeable Stainless Automatic Grinder with Charging Base, Adjustable Coarseness Ele","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T9zIJasbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【One-Hand Operation】: This electric pepper grinder set allows for quick and easy one-handed operation, making it convenient to use while multitasking in the kitchen. Simply hold the electric grinders in one hand, use your thumb to press and hold the switch button, and the grinder will automatically grind your spices for you. 【Adjustable Coarseness】: With this automatic salt and pepper grinder set, Customize the coarseness of your salt and pepper to your liking with the grinder knob located at the bottom of the device. The electric grinder set can produce finely ground or coarsely crushed spices, catering to your individual preferences. 【USB Rechargeable with Dual Charging Base】: The rechargeable electric salt grinder set is designed for easy and efficient charging, featuring a USB rechargeable function and a dual charging base, so you can charge both grinders simultaneously. The set also includes a USB cable and a cleaning brush for proper maintenance. Plus, the bottom cap ensures that your spices remain fresh and protected. 【LED Light and Refillable】: The electric salt and pepper mill set has a built-in LED light that illuminates your food as you grind, allowing you to see precisely how much seasoning you are adding. The large and wide-mouth spice container is transparent, making the auto pepper grinder easy to see when it's time for a refill. This feature helps you to easily distinguish between spices and seasonings, preventing any confusion. 【Ceramic Rotor and stainless steel pepper grinder】: Built to last, the automatic pepper grinder is made with durable stainless steel and features a ceramic core rotor grinder for smooth and effortless grinding. This makes it an ideal tool for everyday use, ensuring that your spices remain fresh and flavorful.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T9zIJasbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AicLuze","source_asin":"B0BP6XZK3Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-264237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP6XZK3Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP6XZK3Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
