window.products.push({"id":264380,"name":"LLappuil Modular Sectional Sofa with Double Chaise, Faux Leather Fabric Convertible 112 Inch U Shaped Sectional with Ottomans, 6 Seater Reversible Mod","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91VFb2E1nGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤High-Quality Faux Leather Fabric: Modular sofa is made of upgraded waterproof and thickened faux leather fabric, which is soft, breathable and wear resistance, with tens of thousands of micro ventilation holes per square meter, excellent air permeability. Waterproof fabrics better protect the internal structure from damage and effectively extend sectional sofa's service life. It has a leather-like touch and visual effect and is more environmentally friendly. ❤Customized Modular Sofa: The sectional sofa consists of a movable seat and assembled armrests, backrests and movable back cushion, which can be freely replaced between various parts and have a flexible layout. You can move and re-matched any modules at any space for this modular sectional sofa. Combine freely into any shape you like, U shaped, L shaped sofa or sofa sleeper bed and so on. ❤Invisible Storage Sofa: All seats of the reversible sectional sofa has a separate storage space for blankets, toys, sundries and more. storage size: 20.47\"(L)*20.47\"(W)*6.30\"(H). Integrating space storage and sofa design to make your home cleaner, also solves the problem of insufficient space for small-sized families. The weight capacity of each seat is 300LB. ❤\"People-Oriented\" Design: Comfortable and full backrest, which perfectly fits the curve of the waist and back, Sofa fully allowing the body to lean on and relax; the large and high-resilience seat bag can release pressure and support in all directions; the high-quality solid wood frame and wood legs are hard and durable; the modular sectional sofa is the perfect interactive place for you and your family to enjoy the ease and pleasure of life. ❤Easy to Assemble and Move Around: Sectional couch overall size: 111.8\"(L)*55.9\"(W)*33.9\"(H), modular sofa is easy to assemble, just follow the instructions, adults can easily complete it in less than half an hour. This sofa includes 7 packages (1 pair of armrests + 4*seats with backrest and back cushion + 2*ottoman). Warm tips: SEVEN PACKAGES may arrive separately within different days, please wait patiently for 2-3 business days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91VFb2E1nGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LLappuil","source_asin":"B0C6CTLN19","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-264380","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6CTLN19","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6CTLN19","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
