window.products.push({"id":264508,"name":"YARENH Knife Block Set, 8 Piece Damascus Chef Knife for Kitchen with Sharpener Stone, High Carbon Stainless Steel, 67 layers,Full Tang, African Sandal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":358.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CVqu3o8DL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"[Sharp Damascus Steel Blade] The Yarenh knife is crafted with highest quality Damascus steel.The blade of the knife is equipped with 67 layers of Damascus steel and the 10Cr15CoMoV high carbon steel is selected for the steel core, whose hardness is stable at 60 ± 2HRC, for that ultra-sharpness and durability of the blade.The Damascus steel contains Cr, Mo, Co ingredient,making the blade more rust-resistant,more wear-resistant,better sharpness. [African Sandalwood Handle] The triple riveted natural wood handle of the knife is constructed with African Sandalwood which is natural solid wood providing you an authentic design and strong grip with durability. Please note that due to the different cutting season, wood location and growth environment, there could be certain differences in the color and texture of the handle, which is a normal phenomenon and cannot be avoided. [Ergonomic Design for Multi-Purpose Use] Our knife is made from the Damascus steel(10Cr15CoMoV steel core), which is a Chinese stainless steel equivalent to Japanese VG10 steel, and the forging process of the knife provides our customers with the highest quality Damascus steel kitchen knife for the ultimate sophisticated cutting experience.The sharp blade and wooden handle ergonomic design makes it an ideal knife for poultry, fish, and as a vegetable etc. [Professional Chef Knife Block Set] The Yarenh knives set includes 8 inch chef knife×1, 7 inch santoku knife×1, 8 inch sashimi knife×1, 5 inch kitchen utility Knife×1, 3.5 inch paring knife×1, knife whetstone×1, knife block×1, kitchen shears×1. The 8-Piece knife set are packaged in the same gift box. [Easy Clean and Friendly Services] After each use, use water to clean the knife, wipe dry and store it in a dry and ventilated place. Kindly avoid soaking and cleaning with saline water. Committed to deliver high quality services, we provide unconditional refund after one month of unsatisfactory experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CVqu3o8DL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YARENH","source_asin":"B07VDQ5JR9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-264508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VDQ5JR9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VDQ5JR9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
