window.products.push({"id":264564,"name":"Andency Black Duvet Cover Queen Size, 3 Pieces Ruffle Duvet Cover Set, Soft Microfiber Queen Duvet Cover Bedding Set with Zipper Closure","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eHZhTUQ9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Black Ruffle Duvet Cover] Andency black duvet cover set adopts vintage ruffle fringe, modern farmhouse style, cute and elegant. There are beautiful ruffles on 3 sides, give you a chic, textured addition to your bedroom decor. Our black ruffled duvet cover set comes with solid color design, simple but stylish. Black duvet cover is suitable for any room, such as a bedroom, guest room, kids room, vacation room, and so on. [Queen Duvet Cover Set] 3 pieces queen duvet cover set Includes 1 ruffle duvet cover (90\"x 90\") and 2 pillowcases(20\"x 26\"). Please confirm your bed size before purchasing. Please kindly note that the comforter, duvet, or pillows are not included. [Ultra-Soft Microfiber] Our ruffle duvet cover set is made from microfiber (no insert is included). This microfiber duvet cover bedding set is soft, breathable, and lightweight. It can bring you a comfortable touch and a warm experience. At the same time, ruffled duvet cover isn't heavy but is a sturdy weight so it will hold up well. You can enjoy a sound and sweet sleep all through the night. [Zipper Closure & Corner Ties] Andency ruffled duvet cover with zipper closure, easy for you to put your comforter or duvet in and out. The hidden zipper keeps it tidy-looking. You also do not have to worry about getting poked in the night with the zipper edge. Our duvet cover set comes with envelope pillowcases, which are simple and convenient(There are no zippers on the shams). In addition, 4 Corner Ties inside are convenient to keep your duvet non-slip, ensuring greater comfort at night. [Multiple Purpose] Such a lovely shabby chic duvet cover will appeal to all tastes. The modern look of the black ruffle softens it, making it look less severe. The solid color is neutral looking and goes well with most decor. Our ruffled duvet cover set is suitable for your daughter to get a lovely bedroom style or updates her bedroom into a princess palace. Or it can complete your farmhouse, shabby chic, French Country, minimalist, or traditional bedroom design perfectly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eHZhTUQ9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Andency","source_asin":"B09FJXBYC3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-264564","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FJXBYC3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FJXBYC3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
