window.products.push({"id":264576,"name":"Sun Disk Lavender/Purple Iridized by Iron Art Glass Designs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LVvPrr1nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Smooth colors of opaque Lavender with transparent Purple. Size is 5\" diameter x 1\" thick. Iridized for reflectivity. Made to hang close to the window. About Art Glass Decorations: Iron Elegance offers authentic, hand crafted art glass decorations from recycled glass. When making art glass, it is impossible to recreate any piece identically. Our art glass may reveal slight imperfections, possibly air bubbles, tool marks, glass and or color pattern irregularities. These are attributes of skilled handcrafted art glass, rather than a mass produced, machined item and do not imply a defect. Images/Product Descriptions- Iron Elegance does its best to provide accurate product details on Amazon. Displayed digital images have the most accurate representation possible. There may be slight differences in color from the image on screen and color of the product you receive due to the user’s screen settings, photo lighting, surfaces photographed on, time of day the photo was taken, and filters applied. Amazon requires items to be imaged on a bright white background. Glass color can look different from natural light to artificial light. When a sphere is presented as a flat image, the camera sees color from both sides of the sphere. Consumer Safety- Our glass ornaments do not represent a safety risk. However, glassware is fragile. If using it beyond the item’s ornamental intent, breakages can occur and broken glass is an injury hazard. Caution should be taken opening of the product package, handling, hanging, and accessibility to children limited. Ornaments are not intended to be worn, nor rubbed on skin.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LVvPrr1nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Iron Elegance","source_asin":"B00B7S51KS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-264576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00B7S51KS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00B7S51KS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":264577,"name":"Beaded Eyeglass Chain Holder Blush Rose Goldtone Pink Champagne 28 inches NEW Fancy Ends","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JAVBHPmGL._AC_.jpg","description":"This Beaded Blush Eyeglass Chain is hand made from Pink Champagne size 11 glass seed beads. The 4mm faceted glass bicone beads are placed at 3-4 inch intervals. The photo does not do these beads justice!! The hand beaded chain is 28 inches long and has Fancy metal ball and black elastic ends to attach your glasses. . I can make my chains any length or color just ask!!! The chain drapes beautifully. It has a delicate appearance and is strung on nylon coated cable for super strength!! The chain is light yet strong. Both ends are reinforced with a wire guardian to protect from breaking. Both ends are secured with double crimps and covers for beauty and comfort. Never lose your reading glasses again! Hand made by me in the United States!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JAVBHPmGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Misty's Miracle Jewelry","source_asin":"B01JMY4F78","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-264577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JMY4F78","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JMY4F78","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":264578,"name":"Mermaid Dream Catchers for Kids, ZUEXT Handmade Blue Mermaid Dream Catcher for Girls Bedroom Wall Hanging Decorations Under The Sea Mermaid Birthday P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ou46yPcNL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"ZUEXT Mermid Dream Catcher with Pearls, star fish, sea shells is Perfect DIY wall art and addition for a nautical theme, beach theme or mermaid theme bedroom, living room, under the sea party decoration. Will be a huge surprise for your boys or girls Large Size Made with an 7.09 inch diameter metal embroidery hoop and is approx. 21.7 inch in total length. NEW DESIGN: Girls Dream Catcher for Bedroom features a glitter mermaid charm gracefully dangled in its center, finished with lovely seashells, starfishes and pearl, an array of purple & blue sparkle ribbons and soft feathers elegantly shines within the suns light Fine hand made crafts Girls: Our dream catcher for kids are original design and fine hand made crafts.Sparkling Mermaid with pearls, shells and sparkling starfishes, so rich and attractive, feel like you’re under the sea. Each mermaid dream catcher needs weaving experience worker to spend (hand made) 3 hours or even more to complete. Great Gift Choice: A Whimsical Dream Catcher, inspired by the fairytales of mermaids in the deep sea water, will be unique mermaid birthday gifts for girls, christmas gifts for kids, new baby gifts for baby shower party, etc Various Occasions: Ideal for nautical theme / under the sea / mermaid theme birthday party, nautical baby shower, ocean theme party, under the sea party, pool party, beach wedding decorations. SWEET DREAMS: Freely hang this Mermaid Theme Beach Dream Catcher on your baby's little bed, so that your bad dreams will be confused and tangled in its web, allows her/his good dreams onlyto slip down the ribbon, let him/her sleep with sweet dreams every night.It brings love and positive energy. Package Includes 1x Mermaid Design Dream Catcher for Bedroom 1x Bohemian Dreamcather Key Chain (Bonus Gift) 2x Hidden Hook Up Nail (Bonus Gift)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ou46yPcNL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZUEXT","source_asin":"B07VBJS79G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-264578","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VBJS79G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VBJS79G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
