window.products.push({"id":264601,"name":"BFOUR Meat Thermometer, Instant Read Meat Thermometer Digital Food Thermometer Waterproof Ultra Fast Candy Kitchen Thermometer for Cooking BBQ Grill S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61orK-cB0zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ULTRA FAST& ACCURATE: 2-4s ultra fast response time with high accuracy of ±1℃/±2℉, ensuring you to quickly judge how long the food will be cooked and get the best flavor. No need to worry about overcooking or under-cooking any more, cook like a pro every time. (Note: for the auto-shut off function, you don’t need to press the button or unscrew the battery out to turn it off , it would Auto-shut off in 5 minutes of no use) FOOD GRADE STAINLESS STEEL& LONG PROBE: 4.52\" long probe provides a safe distance to ensure not to burn your hands. Suitable for smoking, grilling, baking, oven, BBQ, Candy, indoor outdoor cooking. -58℉~572℉ wide measurement range for variety of food: beef, lamb, pork, turkey, fish, bread, jam, chocolate, Oil,Milk Yogurt etc. You can also use it for bath water or other uses. 304 food grade stainless steel probe, safe and reliable. WATERPROOF FOR GENERAL USE& CONVENIENT STORAGE: Easy to clean, washable that you can rinse it directly with water( But please don’t soak it in water, or it will stop working ). Easy to store with magnetic back, simply put the meat thermometer on the refrigerator, grill, smoker etc, or just stand on the table because of its square design. Auto-shut off in 5 minutes of no use to extends your battery life (Battery included). EASY TO USE: Simply insert probe into your food and get the temp in seconds. You can not only read the temp but also the battery usage on the Large LCD screen, read the remaining battery power at any time without suddenly running out of power during use. Hold function&℉/℃ switchable : short press the button to lock the temperature value, hold the best temp readout you need, then record it. And long press the button to switch Celsius/Fahrenheit. Meet your needs for different temperature units. BACKLIGHT& FRIENDLY CUSTOMER SERVICE: Backlight function ensures a clear display in dark or smoky. Lightweight kitchen thermometer ensures no hand fatigue after long time use. Quality food meat thermometer with the RoHS, FCC, CE certification. All our products are available for worry-free 2 year warranty. Be free to contact us if any problems, we will try our best to help you solve it in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61orK-cB0zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BFOUR","source_asin":"B08L4T55J2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-264601","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L4T55J2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L4T55J2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
