window.products.push({"id":264681,"name":"OTOTO Blade Knife Sharpener - Keep Knife Sharper with the Best Knife Sharpener - Fun Kitchen Gadgets BPA-free & Dishwasher-Safe Kitchen Knife Sharpene","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ue0oR2yJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A 'Knife' Friend To Have- What could be worse than a slow knife? A dull one. Keep your knives sharp to the touch with Blade, the knife sharpener. Crafted by the award-winning OTOTO design studio, this nifty friend brings the FUN in functional. Kitchen knives can lose their sharpness after a couple of uses, keep your knives in tip-top shape with Blade the adorable knife sharpener. More than just a novelty item, this cute kitchen tool is a must-have for every home chef. Cutting Edge Gift- Looking for fun kitchen gadgets for your loved ones? OTOTO has a great selection of funny kitchen gadgets that will tickle anyone's fancy. From nifty kitchen tools and adorable household items, we've got you covered. Looking for a gift that's adorkable yet useful? Consider treating you or your loved one with Blade, the kitchen knife sharpener. This little guy will give your worn-out knives a new life—good as new! A Cut Above The Rest- Is your knife not cutting like it used to? Bring back its cutting-edge abilities with Blade, the knife sharpening master! Get slicing and dicing like a pro in no time with the best knife sharpener in the game. If you're on the hunt for new home gift ideas, Blade and the rest of the OTOTO squad are perfect little treats. With their top-notch a'dork'able design, they will surely make every frown upside down. Slice, Slice, Baby!- Blade isn't like other knife sharpeners, this sleepy rhino is a real monster in the kitchen. Made of BPA-free and 100% food-grade material, Blade is a real treat in the kitchen. With Blade by your side, you can keep your knife sharper whenever you need it! Did we mention this rhino is dishwasher-safe? Surprise! You can pop blade in the dishwasher and he'll be squeaky clean, ready for action. Add a little quirky fun to the kitchen counter with kitchen sharpeners like Blade. A Sprinkle of fun - Ever heard of the one where they lived happily ever after? Well, that's always the story with OTOTO's household products. Why? Because everyday chores are no longer a bore when you've got adorable gadgets to explore! Our team strives to create functional products with a quirky and unexpected twist. We love sprinkling in a bit of fun and magic in all that we do and we hope you feel the same way too!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ue0oR2yJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OTOTO","source_asin":"B07N3B143H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-264681","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N3B143H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N3B143H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
