window.products.push({"id":264863,"name":"FavorOnline “Coffee Lover’s Delight” Coffee Scented Candle in Mug Shaped Holder with Plate - Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51E0wTuRE1L._AC_.jpg","description":"Do your guests love coffee? Well you’re in luck; Ruby Blanc’s “Coffee Lover’s Delight” coffee scented candle in mug shaped holder with plate is the perfect elegant yet practical way to please any coffee lover! The delicious scented candle nestled inside a porcelain mug atop a porcelain plate makes a beautiful addition to any event table; coffee anyone?Features and specs:- Includes: Coffee sceented candle in porcelain coffee cup with plate packaged in cellophane with organza ribbon bow and \"Thank You\" gift tag- Coffe cup measures 2\"H x 3 1/2W with handle- Plate measures 4 3/4D- Weight: 0.7lbs- Comes in bulk packaging- UPC: 074614570181","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51E0wTuRE1L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FavorOnline","source_asin":"B00ZH73RGK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-264863","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZH73RGK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZH73RGK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":264864,"name":"2023 Graduation Decorations Silver Black Balloon Garland Kit White Black Balloons Arch Black Agate Balloon Silver Confetti Balloon for Birthday Retire","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qNeKSzBtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TREASURES GIFTED: Make Celebrations Extraordinary! Balloons and fun are almost synonymous; you can't have one without the other! Making simple balloon decorations can make your party amazing! Whether you're a professional decorator or a mom that wants to throw a fun and budget-friendly birthday party for your kids, these balloon garland kits are the right choice for you! THROWING A PARTY FOR THE FIRST TIME? Life can be crazy and hectic with no relief in sight. For this reason, party planning should be the least of your concerns--we have you covered! We're sending you a FREE printable party planner kit with your purchase! Make party planning the most natural part of your day! TIPS FOR KEEPING BALLOONS INFLATED LONGER: 1. Balloons filled with air generally last longer than those filled with helium. On average, helium-filled balloons stay afloat between 6-8 hours, while air-filled ones stay inflated between 8-10 hours outdoors and 12-16 hours indoors. 2. Before the day of the event, test at least one balloon to measure the heat, humidity, and rain at your venue. 3. Do not over inflate balloons with helium if you plan to use it outdoors. Over inflate it first and release some air after. This way, it doesn't pop when the helium inside expands due to higher temperatures. CAUTION: 1. This product contains rubber latex; please avoid contact in case of allergy. 2. Popped latex balloons are choking hazards to kids under eight years. Use with adult supervision. 3. Guidance is also necessary for pets who may accidentally pop the balloons. WHAT YOU'LL ALSO GET: A FREE Printable Party Planning Kit!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qNeKSzBtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Treasures Gifted","source_asin":"B081VS6JJT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-264864","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081VS6JJT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081VS6JJT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":264865,"name":"Peugeot Paris u'Select Salt Mill, 4.73in, White Lacquered","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xbUitoTgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Advantage of Freshly Ground Spices There are many benefits to freshly grinding pepper, salt, herbs and spices for cooking and seasoning. A quality mill with a specifically designed grinding mechanism will release the aromas and essential oils of that spice. Freshly ground pepper and spices have more aroma and better flavor than pre- ground. Another advantage of using freshly ground spices or minerals (salts) is the control a mill provides for determining the coarseness (size) of a grind. A high quality pepper, salt or spice mill gives you the ability to choose and change the coarseness according to taste or necessity. How to Choose a Good Mill When looking for a pepper, salt or spice grinder, consider the following: Grinding mechanism: Choose a grinding mechanism that can withstand daily use: one that is well made and produces a consistent grind. Ideally, the grinding mechanism should be designed to handle a specific spice, as each spice has different physical characteristics that will benefit from different design features. Design and appearance: Whether it's traditional or modern, manual or electric, a mill can be an indispensable tool in your kitchen and a beautiful part of table d�cor. Ease of Use: A quality mill should be easy to adjust, easy to fill, and feel comfortable in the hand. History of Peugeot Peugeot's story starts in the 19th century when the Peugeot brothers converted the family's gristmill into a steel foundry. They began producing award winning hand tools immediately after opening and went on to produce a diverse range of exceptional quality products including small appliances, bicycles and most notably, automobiles. (Although now operating as a separate company, the Peugeot car company continues the same commitment to quality and innovation that is a Peugeot hallmark). In 1840 Peugeot created their burr style coffee grinder and adopted that design to accommodate peppercorns in 1874. The resulting pepper mechanism design is still used today in every Peugeot pepper mill. Peugeot's iconic pepper grinding mechanism design is often copied, but never equaled. Today, Peugeot offers six unique spice-specific mechanisms plus the original burr-style coffee grinder. There are no shortcuts: each mechanism is designed to get the most out of the spices they are intended for. After more than 160 years, Peugeot mills and grinders remain the benchmark of the industry and have earned their position as the mill of choice in world class kitchens. It's All About the Mechanism The primary difference between Peugeot and all other brands are the spice-specific mechanisms. Peugeot has 7 unique spice specific mechanisms for pepper, salt, herbs and spices, coffee, wet salt, chili peppers and nutmeg. For each spice, there is one - and only one - Peugeot grinding mechanism, each made of the ideal design and constructed from the best material available for its intended use. All Peugeot mechanisms are made in France and carry a lifetime limited warranty. Peugeot's Pepper Grinding Mechanism is a two stage burr-style system. During production, the helix-shaped grooves and grinding teeth of the pepper mechanism are individually cut before the steel is case hardened to make it virtually indestructible. The mechanism is then given a proprietary treatment to provide additional protection against corrosion. During use, the helix- shaped grooves guide whole peppercorns through the mechanism to crack, then grind to a consistent size by a double row of teeth. This process releases the pepper's essential oils, resulting in more flavor and aroma for your dish. This patented mechanism is found on every Peugeot Pepper mill and is widely considered the best pepper mechanism available Peugeot's Salt Crushing Mechanism features two ribbed plates which work to fracture and crush coarse, dry sea salt to a consistent size. The salt grinding mechanism is made of corrosion resistant Stainless Steel, and is found on every Peugeot Salt Mill. A Peugeot Innovation u'Select is Peugeot's patented grind control system for electric and manual grinders. Beyond personal preferences, different stages of the preparation / cooking process and different dishes often call for seasonings of varying sizes. Peugeot now offers the ability to quickly, easily and accurately adjust the grind settings with its patented u'Select system. From coarsely ground pepper or salt to very fine, u'Select offers: -6 pre-defined levels of grind for pepper, or any point in between. -6 pre-defined levels of grind for salt, or any point in between. Simplicity: just turn the ring at the base of the mill and select your grind size. The further you turn the ring, the finer or coarser the grind, depending on the direction turned. Precision: no risk that the grind will change during use. The right grind: You are assured that with each setting, the grind will be consistent, time after time. Fine or coarse grind-is it just a question of taste? Actually it depends ","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xbUitoTgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peugeot","source_asin":"B0C67DP9B5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-264865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C67DP9B5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C67DP9B5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
